# SWARM Browser extra GN args.
#
# build.py appends this file after ungoogled-chromium/flags.gn and
# flags.windows.gn, so anything set here wins over both.
#
# Deliberately empty for the first build: ungoogled-chromium's flags.gn already
# removes the Google API keys, Safe Browsing, reporting, the variations seed,
# Hangouts, remoting, mDNS and service discovery, and the SWARM privacy
# defaults are patches (swarm/patches/swarm/swarm-privacy-defaults.patch)
# rather than GN args. Every arg added here has to survive
# `gn gen --fail-on-unused-args`, so add one at a time and prove it in CI.
